1
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:12,930
This is Earth, seventy million years ago.

2
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:15,720
Mayuri?

3
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:21,810
You were sent here by a time machine.

4
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:23,690
Is that you, Mayuri?

5
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:27,150
Mayushii has looked for Okarin

6
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:33,780
in many, many, many world lines, chasing him.

7
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:34,570
Mayuri?

8
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:37,620
You could say that the Okarin here

9
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:40,910
is one of many Okarins. And you could say that

10
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:42,920
he's the original Okarin.

11
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,460
And you could also say the Mayushii here

12
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:49,170
is one of many Mayushiis. And you could say that

13
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:51,220
she's the original, too.

14
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:53,130
And so,

15
00:00:53,130 --> 00:00:56,890
I think Okarin and Mayushii are gonna die here.

16
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:00,020
But I believe

17
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:02,230
that our wills will carry on

18
00:01:02,230 --> 00:01:06,820
to the Okarin and Mayushii, in Akihabara, 
seventy million years from now.

19
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:07,940
So...

20
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:10,240
It's okay.

